4. What are the advantages of using the A algorithm over other search algorithms?*
Answer: The A* algorithm offers several advantages:
•	Optimality: If the heuristic is admissible (never overestimates the cost), A* guarantees finding the shortest path to the goal.
•	Completeness: A* will always find a solution if one exists, as long as the search space is finite.
•	Efficiency: By using both the actual cost (g(n)) and the heuristic estimate (h(n)), A* explores the most promising paths first, reducing the search space and making it more efficient than other uninformed algorithms like BFS.
